+# RSpec Test Suite Profiling & Optimization Notes
+
+This document tracks baseline metrics, profiling findings, implemented optimizations, and plans for upcoming optimization phases.
+
+## Metrics Summary
+
+*(Default exclusions: `streaming: true`, `search: true`, `js: true`; single process, no parallelization.)*
+
+| Suite Group | Examples | Baseline (Pre-Optimization) | Post-Phase 1 (`models`) | Post-Phase 2 (`requests`) | Post-Phase 3 (`factories`) | Speedup |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| `spec/models` | 1,795 | ~224.3s (profiled) | 32.1s | 31.0s (warm) | **23.2s** (22.3s–24.0s warm) | **-25.2%** vs Phase 2, **~9.7x faster** vs baseline |
+| `spec/requests` | 1,877 | >180s (pre-Phase 1) | 137.9s | 51.1s (warm) | **41.2s** (warm) | **-19.4%** vs Phase 2, **>4.4x faster** vs baseline |
+| **Combined (`models` + `requests`)** | **3,672** | **>400s (>6m 40s)** | **170.0s (2m 50s)** | **82.1s (1m 22s)** | **64.4s (1m 04s)** | **-21.6% (1.27x faster)** vs Phase 2, **>6.2x faster** vs baseline |
+
+*(Note: Phase 2 vs Phase 3 comparisons above were measured back-to-back on the same warm container environment: `spec/models` dropped from `30.98s` to `22.33s–24.00s` and `spec/requests` dropped from `51.11s` to `41.21s`, saving ~17.7s / -21.6% combined.)*
+
+### Detailed `spec/models` Telemetry (TestProf Before vs After Phase 3)
