+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| Clean warm wall-clock runtime | 30.98s | 22.33s–24.00s | **-22.5% to -27.9%** |
+| `RSpecDissect` total setup time | 21.21s | 13.80s | **-34.9%** |
+| `sql.active_record` queries / time | 46,952 / 6.93s | 32,456 / 4.31s | **-30.9% queries, -37.8% SQL time** |
+| `FactoryProf` total records / time | 2,968 / 22.81s | 2,123 / 14.49s–16.19s | **-28.5% records, -29% to -36.5% factory time** |
+| `status` factory calls / time | 483 / 7.52s (15.6ms/call) | 422 / 2.64s (6.3ms/call) | **-64.9% time (2.5x faster/call)** |
+| `bookmark` factory calls / time | 486 / 4.10s (4 top-level) | 4 / 0.04s (4 top-level) | **-99.2% calls, -99.0% time** |
+| `login_activity` factory calls | 252 (0 top-level) | 0 | **-100%** |
+| `preview_card` + `preview_card_trend` | 38 / 1.05s | 38 / 0.06s | **-94.3% time (~17x faster)** |
+| `status_trend` factory calls / time | 17 / 0.51s | 17 / 0.18s | **-64.7% time** |
