+| `FactoryProf` total records / time | 11,030 / 118.3s | 4,470 / 27.62s | 2,315 / 14.71s | **-48.2% records, -46.7% factory time** |
+| `user` factory calls / time | — | 485 / 5.72s | 287 / 1.96s | **-40.8% calls, -65.7% time** |
+| `accessible_access_token` calls | — | 595 / 0.76s | 217 / 0.27s | **-63.5% calls, -64.5% time** |
+| `bookmark` factory calls / time | 1,459 / — | 372 / 4.16s (9 top) | 9 / 0.12s (9 top) | **-97.6% calls, -97.1% time** |
